  "system": {
    "biography": "<p><em>\"Building security, barely trained and nearly inexperienced.\"</em> The guards in the Pacific Towers lobby and on the residential floors.</p><p>Worth knowing: this block is <strong>attribute-identical to SR2's own Corporate Security Guard archetype</strong> (core p.205) — same eight attributes, same skills except SR2 adds Interrogation 2. The SR1 adventure and the SR2 core are printing the same archetype under two names.</p><p><em>Queen Euphoria p.15, verified from a render. The old actor was wrong on six counts: Charisma, Intelligence and Willpower all 3 instead of 2, an Armor Jacket instead of the printed Armor Vest, the wrong pistol, and no Etiquette.</em></p>",
